sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as AI client
  participant M as ZyroPay MCP
  participant S as Seller (x402)
  participant A as ZyroPay API
  participant U as You
  participant L as Cardano preprod
  C->>M: pay_x402 with resourceUrl and maxAmount
  M->>S: GET the resource
  S-->>M: 402 PAYMENT-REQUIRED (exact, cardano:preprod, amount, payTo, maxTimeoutSeconds)
  M->>A: create the request with the requirements
  Note over A: Check requirements and policy. Build an ADA transfer to payTo, valid at most maxTimeoutSeconds
  A-->>C: PENDING_APPROVAL
  U->>A: approve with your passkey (body hash)
  Note over A: The API attaches the witness and broadcasts nothing
  C->>M: get_approval_status
  M->>A: fetch the payment header
  M->>S: retry the exact URL with PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
  Note over S: Facilitator verifies, the handler runs, settlement only if status is below 400
  S->>L: facilitator submits the transaction
  S-->>M: 200, report, PAYMENT-RESPONSE, X-Delivery-Receipt
  M->>A: report delivery: the receipt and its own SHA-256 of the body
  A->>L: follow the tx to CONFIRMED
  M-->>C: the paid response and the receipt verdict
